      "$description": "── Index + affordance pair ────────────────────────────────────────── The round `+` chip and the index label that sits opposite it share one box height across the whole site, so a card header row is the same height whether it carries a number, a +, or both. Before this the chip was 2.25rem on the FAQ, 2.25–2.75rem on the tag field and the index was a bare inline span, so no two headers lined up."
